        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Caroline Wozniacki, Simone Bolelli, Akiko Morigami, Potito Starace\n- Events: 2007 Mirage Cup – Singles, 2010 Sporting Challenger – Singles\n- Topics: professional tennis players, singles finals\n\nFacts:\n- Simone Bolelli was born on 8 October 1985 and is an Italian professional tennis player.\n- Caroline Wozniacki was born on 11 July 1990 and is a Danish professional tennis player.\n- In the 2007 Mirage Cup – Singles final, Caroline Wozniacki defeated Akiko Morigami 6–3, 6–2.\n- In the 2010 Sporting Challenger – Singles final, Simone Bolelli defeated Potito Starace 7–6, 6–2.",
